{"id":"certamente","lemma":"certamente","pos":"adv","rank":902,"glosses":["certainly"],"ipa":"/ˌsɛɾ.tɐˈmẽ.tɨ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/dc/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-certamente.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-certamente.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Isso é certamente possível.","en":"That's certainly possible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/469724","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"possible"}]},{"text":"\"Posso entrar?\" \"Sim, certamente.\"","en":"\"May I come in?\" \"Yes, certainly.\"","words":[{"g":"to be able to","l":"poder"},{"g":"to enter"},{"g":"yes"},null]},{"text":"Tom certamente tem jeito com crianças.","en":"Tom certainly has a way with children.","words":[{"g":"tone"},null,{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},{"g":"way, manner, fashion"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"child","l":"criança"}]},{"text":"Tom certamente sabia do problema.","en":"Tom certainly knew about the problem.","words":[{"g":"tone"},null,{"g":"to be aware, to know","l":"saber"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"problem"}]},{"text":"Eu certamente não quero isso.","en":"I certainly don't want that.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"that"}]}]}